    "description": "Synthetic Korean rural valley: two ridges, a valley floor, three hamlets, a single-egress spur, a two-connection loop, an orphan track, and an unnoded crossing. Built so the QA report has positive cases rather than a clean sheet.\n",
    "notes": "Every layer is DataClass.SYNTHETIC. Deliberate findings: SYN-V-003 has age strata that do not sum to its total, a total below the k-anonymity floor, and an UNKNOWN count basis; the forest track crosses the trunk road with no shared node; one road segment is an orphan.\n",
